preview/

# Preview screenshots are generated; the supplied campaign art is not.
*.png
!assets/props/*.png
!assets/logos/*.png
!assets/badges/*.png

# Layered originals stay out. Six posters at 24-38MB each is 176MB, which would
# be two thirds again on top of a 270MB repository, for files git cannot diff and
# nothing here loads: the covers are authored SVGs in assets/brand/aiad27/.
